    {
      "id": "claim_086ca57748eb48ebac4ac249f4667481",
      "statement": "`main()` runs an infinite reconnect loop: establish DB schema, connect RabbitMQ, assert queues, start consumer, wait for session end, close connection, sleep `3000 ms`, and retry. On `SIGTERM`, `stopping` is set, the HTTP server is closed, the DB pool is drained, and the process exits.",
